  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div><div><div><p>Landmark AI laws and the dates they bite, taken from our audited bill registry. Every status and date below links to the statute's primary government source.</p><section data-section=\"live-law-updates\"><div><p><span>● Live</span></p><h2>Latest AI law news across the states</h2><p><span>Updated <!-- -->July 16, 2026</span></p></div><p>The newest AI regulation and policy headlines from across all 50 states, aggregated automatically. Follow each link for the full story.</p></section><section data-section=\"federal-bills\"><div><p><span>Federal</span></p><h2>Federal AI bills in Congress</h2><p><span>Updated <!-- -->July 16, 2026</span></p></div><p>The newest AI-related bills moving through the U.S. Congress, tracked automatically from Congress.gov.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/9715\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><div><p><span>HR 9715</span><span>To permit the use of artificial intelligence in arbitration, and for other purposes.</span></p><p>Referred to the House Committee on the Judiciary.</p><p><span>Congress.gov</span><span>· <!-- -->119<!-- -->th Congress</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-07-15\">Latest action <!-- -->July 15, 2026</time><span>→</span></p></div></a><a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/9706\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><div><p><span>HR 9706</span><span>To require operators of wagering or prediction market platforms to use facial recognition technology to verify the age of users of such wagering or prediction market platforms, and for other purposes.</span></p><p>Referred to the Committee on Agriculture, and in addition to the Committee on Energy and Commerce, for a period to be subsequently determined by the Speaker, in each case for consideration of such provisions as fall within the jurisdiction of the committee concerned.</p><p><span>Congress.gov</span><span>· <!-- -->119<!-- -->th Congress</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-07-15\">Latest action <!-- -->July 15, 2026</time><span>→</span></p></div></a><a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/2152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><div><p><span>HR 2152</span><span>AI PLAN Act</span></p><p>Placed on the Union Calendar, Calendar No. 615.</p><p><span>Congress.gov</span><span>· <!-- -->119<!-- -->th Congress</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-06-24\">Latest action <!-- -->June 24, 2026</time><span>→</span></p></div></a><a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/9686\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><div><p><span>HR 9686</span><span>To increase access to artificial intelligence through programs of the Department of Agriculture, and for other purposes.</span></p><p>Referred to the House Committee on Agriculture.</p><p><span>Congress.gov</span><span>· <!-- -->119<!-- -->th Congress</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-07-14\">Latest action <!-- -->July 14, 2026</time><span>→</span></p></div></a></div></section><div><h2>Popular Questions</h2></div></div><div><div><p>Free · No signup</p><h3>Free AI Risk Snapshot</h3><p>Answer 4 quick questions and see which AI laws apply to your business, your risk level, and the first actions to take. No email required.</p><p><a href=\"https://ai-law-tracker.com/quiz\">Take the Free Assessment →</a></p></div><div><p>Developers · Free API</p><h3>Build on the data — JSON API</h3><p>Every AI law &amp; bill we track — US state &amp; federal, EU, global — as a clean, versioned JSON API with a changelog and webhooks. Free self-serve key, no card.</p><p><a href=\"https://ai-law-tracker.com/developers\">Explore the Developer API →</a></p></div></div></div><section><h2>AI Law Status Across the US</h2><p>Click any state for full compliance details</p><div><div><p>8</p><p>In Effect</p><p>Obligations in force</p></div><di